This is the new file format for TSP parameters.
It is compatible with the 9.3.1 lsa.c and sa.h
of LJ and FLY code and version 3.0 of TSP. Once 
fully tested, it will become TSP version 9.3.1


$annealing_input
seed_for_random_number_generator:
779657008
start_temperature
5000000
gain_for_jump_size_control:
1
interval:
100
$$

$tune_parameters
lambda__lambdamemu_lambdamemv_control:
.000005 200. 1000. 1.
initmoves_tau_freezecount_Sskip:
100000 100 5 1
criterion:
0.0
mix_interval__glob_interval__ngroups:
100 100 5
score_criterion
2
$$

$equilibrate
end_T:
5000000
fix_T_skip:
2000
fix_T_step:
100000
$$


$distribution_parameters
dist_type(1=exp_2=uni_3=nor_4=lor_5=lor2_6=poi_7=gen_8=stdnor_9=par_10=nor2):
1 2
$$


$tsp_instance

